## Scripts

| Script | What it does |
| --- | --- |
{{#when "provides('language:typescript') && (!provides('ui') || provides('http'))"}}
| `{{ pm.run }} dev` | Run the app with reload on change |
| `{{ pm.run }} build` | Compile TypeScript to `dist/` |
| `{{ pm.run }} start` | Run the compiled output |
| `{{ pm.run }} typecheck` | Typecheck without emitting |
{{/when}}
{{#when "provides('language:javascript') && (!provides('ui') || provides('http'))"}}
| `{{ pm.run }} dev` | Run the app with reload on change |
| `{{ pm.run }} start` | Run the app |
{{/when}}
{{#when "provides('ui') && provides('http')"}}
| `{{ pm.run }} dev:web` | Run the frontend in `web/` |
| `{{ pm.run }} build:web` | Build the frontend in `web/` |
{{/when}}
{{#when "provides('lint')"}}
| `{{ pm.run }} lint` | Lint the project |
| `{{ pm.run }} format` | Format the project |
{{/when}}
{{#when "provides('test')"}}
| `{{ pm.run }} test` | Run the test suite |
{{/when}}
{{#when "provides('orm')"}}
| `{{ pm.run }} db:push` | Apply the schema to the database |
| `{{ pm.run }} db:studio` | Browse the data |
{{/when}}
{{#when "has('infra/docker-compose')"}}
| `{{ pm.run }} compose:up` | Build and start the whole stack |
{{/when}}

{{#when "provides('config:env')"}}
## Configuration

Every variable the app needs is listed in `.env.example` and validated at boot
by `src/config/env.{{#when "provides('language:typescript')"}}ts{{else}}js{{/when}}`. The process exits immediately if one is missing
or malformed, so a misconfigured deploy fails loudly instead of at the first
request.
{{/when}}

